      <method name="undo" c:identifier="pps_undo_context_undo">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="libview/context/pps-undo-context.c"
             line="223">This pops the last action on the undo stack and undoes it by calling the
undo interface method of the `PpsUndoHandler` associated to the action.
While undoing, the `PpsUndoHandler` should add a new action with
`pps_undo_context_add_action` to redo what has just been undone, it will be
added to the redo stack by the undo context.</doc>
